---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
---
<Platform title="About the Digivated Project Directory" description="Discover independent projects, meet their makers, and share your work on Digivated.">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT DIGIVATED</p><h1>About Digivated</h1><p class="lede">Digivated is where indie makers launch what they build. Makers post their projects. Everyone else can browse, upvote, and leave feedback.</p></header>
  <figure class="ascii-brand-art"><img src="/digivated-ascii-art.png" alt="Digivated ASCII artwork, a builder at work" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></figure>
  <div class="about-copy">
    <div class="about-values">
      <div><h2>Discover a project.</h2><p>Browse the <a href="/discover">indie project directory</a> to find projects and meet their makers.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Help good work stand out.</h2><p>Leave feedback on project listings, upvote projects you like, and discover more in the <a href="/discover">Directory</a>.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Find your next resource.</h2><p>Browse handpicked sites by category, or save projects to your own collections.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Share what you’re building.</h2><p>Create a free account and submit your project. Its status and any feedback show up in your dashboard.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p>Launching is free and goes live on a Monday. Want it live now? Pay $3 and it publishes right away.</p>
    <p><a href="/shop">Membership</a> is $5, once. Members get full access: a member badge, one reviewed spotlight, full News, the UI/UX Prompt Packet, and member guides.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/discover">Explore projects</a><a class="button" href="/submit-project">Submit a project</a></div>
  </div>
</Platform>
